# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Deploy model Qiskit Code Assistant secara lokal "
"melalui Ollama secara manual\">\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Ada banyak cara untuk men-deploy dan berinteraksi dengan model Qiskit Code "
"Assistant yang sudah diunduh. Panduan ini mendemonstrasikan penggunaan "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) sebagai berikut: baik dengan [aplikasi "
"Ollama](#using-the-ollama-application) menggunakan integrasi Hugging Face "
"Hub atau model lokal, maupun dengan [paket `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-"
"cpp-python).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Menggunakan aplikasi Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aplikasi Ollama menyediakan solusi sederhana untuk menjalankan LLM secara "
"lokal. Aplikasi ini mudah digunakan, dengan CLI yang membuat seluruh proses "
"setup, manajemen model, dan interaksi cukup mudah. Ini ideal untuk "
"eksperimen cepat dan untuk pengguna yang ingin menangani lebih sedikit "
"detail teknis.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Instal Ollama {#install-ollama}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Unduh [aplikasi Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Instal file yang telah diunduh\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Luncurkan aplikasi Ollama yang sudah terinstal\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        Aplikasi berjalan dengan sukses ketika ikon Ollama muncul di menu bar desktop. Kamu juga bisa memverifikasi layanan berjalan dengan membuka `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr "Coba Ollama di terminalmu dan mulai menjalankan model. Misalnya:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan Ollama menggunakan integrasi Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-ollama-"
"using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Integrasi Ollama/Hugging Face Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) "
"menyediakan cara untuk berinteraksi dengan model yang di-host di Hugging "
"Face Hub tanpa perlu membuat modelfile baru atau mengunduh file GGUF atau "
"safetensors secara manual. File `template` dan `params` default sudah "
"disertakan untuk model di Hugging Face Hub.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Pastikan aplikasi Ollama sedang berjalan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buka halaman model yang diinginkan, dan salin URL-nya. Misalnya, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Dari terminalmu, jalankan perintah:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa menggunakan model `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` atau "
"salah satu model GGUF resmi lainnya yang saat ini direkomendasikan "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` atau "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"Menyiapkan Ollama dengan model GGUF Qiskit Code Assistant yang diunduh "
"secara manual {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-"
"assistant-gguf-model}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kalau kamu sudah mengunduh model GGUF secara manual seperti "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF dan kamu ingin "
"bereksperimen dengan template dan parameter yang berbeda, kamu bisa "
"mengikuti langkah-langkah ini untuk memuatnya ke aplikasi Ollama lokalmu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buat sebuah `Modelfile` dengan memasukkan konten berikut dan pastikan "
"memperbarui `<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` ke path sebenarnya dari model yang kamu "
"unduh.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

